  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Political leadership on HIV, Univ. of Cape Town</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Politiskt ledarskap kring HIV, Univ. of Cape Town - Pol leadership HIV, UnvCT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vilka blir politiska f&#xf6;rk&#xe4;mpar inom HIV &amp; AIDS? Ett  forskningsprojekt, baserat p&#xe5; University of Cape Town, om de faktorer som p&#xe5;verkar och avg&#xf6;r hur ett effektivt politisk ledarskap inom HIV-prevention i hyperendemiska l&#xe4;nder byggs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">What Makes Political Champions on AIDS? A research project, based at the University of Cape Town, on the factors that determine effective political leadership on HIV prevention in the hyperendemic countries.</narrative>
  </description>
